# Trivy risk acceptances for the CampusCart image gate (rules: docs/SUPPLY-CHAIN.md).
# Every entry needs these three comment lines directly above it:
#   # reason: why it is accepted or not exploitable here
#   # owner: who answers for it
#   # expires: YYYY-MM-DD   (also written as exp:YYYY-MM-DD on the ID line, so Trivy itself enforces it)
# Entry format:  CVE-YYYY-NNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
# No active entries today. The gate runs with --ignore-unfixed, which already skips CVEs that have no fix yet.
